  designNotes: 'NOT YET measured via SampleAnimation (Editor was closed when this was
    created - built via batchmode from the new Breakdance_1990 take instead). Hit
    windows are a placeholder guess (mid-clip leg sweep, alternating feet) - selection
    fields (min/maxDistance, maxAngleDegrees, cooldown, weights) are irrelevant/unused
    for this attack since it is never chosen by PickAttack() - see BossStateMachine.TryEnterBreakdance,
    which queues it purely off BossTuning.BreakdanceTriggerSeconds regardless of distance/angle.
